{"type":"text","timestamp":1794384960636,"sessionID":"ses_e36593cbfffeDJ07ROdb5qGDwP","part":{"id":"prt_1c9ad9c62001RFqbLCH4QJZYj5","messageID":"msg_1c9ad83e50019lcajxv5M4EKW1","sessionID":"ses_e36593cbfffeDJ07ROdb5qGDwP","type":"text","text":"Done. The store finder is complete:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): full Flask API with `/api/auth/register`, `/api/auth/login`, `/api/stores` (name/address search + haversine distance/radius sorting), `/api/stores/{id}`, and admin-only CRUD at `/api/admin/stores`. Admin account (`admin`) password comes from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (disabled when unset). Seeded 8 sample stores, SQLite under `./data`, signed tokens via `itsdangerous` (added to `requirements.txt`/`requirements.lock`).\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/src/`): React + TypeScript + Tailwind (v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`), with admin sign-in, search box, \"Use my location\" + radius selector (denial keeps plain list with a note), a self-drawn SVG plot of stores + visitor, and admin add/edit forms showing API validation messages plus delete confirmation.\n\nVerified: `npm run build` passes and all API endpoints behave correctly (auth, sorting, distance ordering, validation, phone-clearing on PUT, reserved admin name, 401/403/404).","time":{"start":1794384960610,"end":1794384960614}}}
